1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,200
Hey! Stop!
嘿！停下！

2
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:08,237
Ming always said the same thing about English:
说起英语，阿明总是那一句话：

3
00:00:08,297 --> 00:00:09,897
“I'll learn it later.”
“以后再学。”

4
00:00:10,121 --> 00:00:14,205
Words he didn't know? He skipped them.
Questions? He never asked.
不认识的词？跳过。有问题？从来不问。

5
00:00:14,555 --> 00:00:18,820
For three weeks, he built a robot
for an international science camp.
整整三个星期，他都在为一个国际科学营做机器人。

6
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:21,423
Then an email came. All in English.
后来，来了一封邮件，全是英文。

7
00:00:21,573 --> 00:00:25,059
He didn't get it, and he didn't ask. “Later,” he thought.
他没看懂，也没去问。“以后再说吧。”他想。

8
00:00:25,609 --> 00:00:29,756
On Monday, he finally learned what it said: Sign up by Friday.
到了星期一，他才弄明白邮件写的是：最迟星期五完成报名。

9
00:00:30,006 --> 00:00:33,124
The robot was ready. But this chance was gone.
机器人已经做好了，可这一次机会已经错过了。

10
00:00:34,574 --> 00:00:37,527
That summer, his class took a school trip abroad.
那年夏天，他们班出国研学。

11
00:00:37,677 --> 00:00:41,565
Hey! Stop! That area is closed for repairs. It's not safe!
嘿！停下！那边正在维修，暂不开放。不安全！

12
00:00:41,625 --> 00:00:45,641
Ming heard the words, but he didn't understand them.
He kept walking.
阿明听到了，却没听懂，继续往前走。

13
00:00:45,701 --> 00:00:49,110
A worker ran over and pulled him back, just in time.
一位工作人员冲过来把他拉了回去，幸好来得及。

14
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:52,869
Some English isn't for tests. It keeps you safe.
有些英语不只是为了考试，它能保护你的安全。

15
00:00:53,819 --> 00:00:58,713
Later, he stopped to watch a robot.
When he turned around, his group was gone.
后来，他停下来看一个机器人。一转身，同学们都不见了。

16
00:00:58,963 --> 00:01:03,249
He went straight to the information desk.
That was the right thing to do.
他直接去了服务台。这样做是对的。

17
00:01:03,309 --> 00:01:06,380
Hi there. Are you okay? Who are you here with?
你好，你还好吗？你是跟谁一起来的？

18
00:01:06,440 --> 00:01:11,014
His face got hot. His mind went blank. Every minute felt longer.
他脸发烫，脑子一片空白。每一分钟都变得更漫长。

19
00:01:11,464 --> 00:01:14,129
Then he remembered one sentence from class.
这时，他想起了课上学过的一句话。

20
00:01:14,189 --> 00:01:16,626
“I don't understand. Can you help me?”
“我不明白，你能帮帮我吗？”

21
00:01:16,686 --> 00:01:20,514
Of course. Stay right here with me. Let's call your teacher.
当然可以。就在这儿跟我待着，我们给你的老师打电话。

22
00:01:20,964 --> 00:01:23,277
One sentence made a big difference.
一句话，带来了很大的不同。

23
00:01:24,527 --> 00:01:28,372
Ming saw it now: the longer you wait, the bigger the gaps get.
阿明终于明白：拖得越久，不懂的地方就越多。

24
00:01:28,432 --> 00:01:30,712
But you can start closing them today.
但你可以从今天开始，一点点补上。

25
00:01:31,362 --> 00:01:37,088
Just ten minutes. Hear one sentence.
Repeat it a few times. Then say it on your own.
今天先学十分钟：听懂一句，跟读几遍，再自己说出来。

26
00:01:37,238 --> 00:01:40,046
And when you don't understand, ask right away.
遇到不懂的，马上问。

27
00:01:40,296 --> 00:01:41,896
Start today.
从今天开始。
